  formats -->|validate extension| limits
  limits -->|accepted file| convert
  convert -->|WAV| vad
  vad -->|speech intervals| segments
  segments -->|audio transcript| transcribe
  segments -->|selected intervals| features
  transcribe -->|transcript validation| empty
  features -->|derived file cleanup| clean
  empty -->|finally| clean
